# Bolt. II (turn 3): no Army, so a 0/0 black Goblin Army token is created and gets a +1/+1 counter: a 1/1 Goblin Army.
# III (turn 5): Bot2 loses 1 life and Bot1 gains 1. IV (turn 7): the same again, and the Saga, having reached its last chapter
# and with nothing on the stack, is sacrificed (CR 714.4) - the Army stays.

